        <title>butter_chicken:vegetarian</title>
        <link>https://alephnull.org/w/butter_chicken/vegetarian?rev=1649534731&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Butter Chicken (vegetarian)

Marinade for chicken/tofu:

	*  1 Tbsp cornstarch
	*  1-2 Tbsp garam or tandoori masala
	*  1/2 tsp ground ginger
	*  1/2 tsp garlic powder
	*  1/2 tsp turmeric
	*  Optional: curry powder, coconut oil, chili powder, salt</description>
    </item>
